atlas model
# Harvested run6/run7 model estate above FPQ/SLI/KV: representation, topology,
# prepared execution. Registered architectural until built.

architecture model-representation-graph
  canonical_name ModelRepresentationGraph
  family model
  domain Model / Representation
  layer model/representation
  semantic_question What representation profile is this model in, and what invalidates it?
  purpose Binds model identity, representation profile, prepared state, execution phenotype, runtime capability with separate invalidation domains, so changing one does not silently invalidate another. FPQ is representation, never identity.
  maturity architectural
  node_types ModelPassport
  edge_types represented_as
  forbidden_inference low reconstruction error -> good semantic generation
  forbidden_inference representation -> model identity
  interacts fpq-transform
  source_lineage run6/run7 model estate
  known_gap not built; FPQTransformation is one representation already measured

architecture model-topology-graph
  canonical_name ModelTopologyGraph
  family model
  domain Model / Topology
  layer model/representation
  semantic_question What is this model's architecture, layers, and tensor namespace?
  purpose The structural identity of a model -- architecture, layer graph, tensor namespace -- separate from its representation and its execution.
  maturity architectural
  node_types Layer
  edge_types feeds
  forbidden_inference same topology -> same weights or same representation
  source_lineage run6/run7 model estate
  known_gap not built

architecture prepared-execution-graph
  owns ExecutionReceipt
  consumes RouteAdvertisement
  consumes ReachableCapacity
  consumes FPQRepresentation
  consumes KVPassport
  publishes ExecutionReceipt
  canonical_name PreparedExecutionGraph
  family model
  domain Model / Execution
  layer model/execution
  semantic_question Given this representation and hardware, what prepared executable artifact and lease exists?
  purpose Source model -> representation -> preparation params -> hardware feature set -> prepared artifact -> resident resource -> runtime lease -> session, with invalidation edges. The chain that turns a representation into something running.
  maturity architectural
  node_types PreparedExecutionArtifact
  node_types RuntimeLease
  edge_types prepares
  edge_types invalidates
  forbidden_inference prepared -> authorized to run
  interacts model-representation-graph
  interacts tract
  source_lineage run6/run7 model estate
  known_gap not built
